  _headline: Sensor avisa antes de a bomba quebrar
  _headlineEn: Sensors warn before the pump breaks
  _body: "Algoritmos medem vibra\xE7\xE3o e desgaste e alertam antes da falha. O
    vereador Josu\xE9 lamenta perder a foto na obra de emerg\xEAncia."
  _bodyEn: "Algorithms track vibration and wear and raise the alarm before failure.
    Councilman Josu\xE9 mourns his emergency repair photo-op."
